{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in California (districts 1–26)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in California (districts 1–26)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1–26)","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in California (districts 1–26)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in California (districts 1–26)</span></span>"},"pageid":84281645,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Great_Seal_of_the_State_of_California_Colored.svg/330px-Great_Seal_of_the_State_of_California_Colored.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Great_Seal_of_the_State_of_California_Colored.svg/1920px-Great_Seal_of_the_State_of_California_Colored.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":1430,"height":1430},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376975079","tid":"30cd7886-ba35-11f1-b4b1-39d10ee9fdc8","timestamp":"2026-09-27T05:35:04Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_California_(districts_1%E2%80%9326)"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in California will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 52 U.S. representatives from the state of California, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The passage of Proposition 50 in 2025 significantly altered many districts. The primary elections took place on June 2, 2026.\n","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in California</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 52 U.S. representatives from the state of California, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The passage of Proposition 50 in 2025 significantly altered many districts. The primary elections took place on June 2, 2026.</p>\n"}